  "goodToKnow": "Werktags means on weekdays or working days, common on timetables and opening hours: werktags 8–18 Uhr. Careful: legally, a Werktag in Germany includes Saturday, so werktags often means Monday to Saturday, while Arbeitstag usually means Monday to Friday. The opposite is sonn- und feiertags. Delivery times like drei Werktage include Saturdays."
